# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and the working tree.
# The repo had no .gitattributes and core.autocrlf left some corpora committed
# with CRLF, which showed as permanent "modified" churn against the LF the
# converters write. text=auto lets git auto-detect binary; eol=lf pins text to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
